# D3-TR-001: A conservative salt pulse followed by a clean-water chase
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
new
new
new
add v1 water 20mL
add v2 water 20mL
add v3 water 20mL
add v4 water 20mL
add v4 NaCl 0.0002mol
add v6 water 20mL
transport v1 v2 v3 from v4 to v5 steps 1 courant 1
inspect
transport v1 v2 v3 from v6 to v5 steps 4 courant 1
measure v1 conductivity
measure v2 conductivity
measure v3 conductivity
measure v5 conductivity
inspect
